     "excerpt": "The current draft keeps the S2 failure-rate limit at 8%, rather than the discussed 5% cap, and limits per-model submissions to regulators; preserve those protections in any further edits. S5’s >8/100k rule triggers review, not an automatic recall, which is important given our company-wide rate. Avoid changing that to an automatic trigger."
